# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [1.9.2] - 2025-05-17

### Fixed

- Fixed memory consumption issues in analysis service for large audio files
- Implemented memory-efficient processing in Python analyzer
- Added memory monitoring and adaptive resource usage
- Improved error handling for analysis job failures
- Updated Docker configuration for more reliable operation

